WEBVTT

open
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
Every AI lab says its model is best. Few tell you what a task costs.

title
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.600
aicharts. See which AI model wins at each price.

step-1
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:13.200
Score and cost, one chart. 97 model settings by score and cost per task. The line joins the models nothing cheaper beats.

step-2
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:18.800
Coding agents as you run them. 20 setups: a model, the agent app and an effort. Hover one for cost, time and tokens.

step-3
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:24.400
Your own token use. The collector adds up your agents' tokens, cost and time per model and day.

step-4
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:29.500
Numbers leave, words never do. Prompts, transcripts, file paths and keys stay on your machine.

proof
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:34.000
97 model settings on the score and cost chart. 20 coding-agent setups. 62 benchmarks in the library. From the checked snapshots each chart plots.

limits
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.000
What it does not do. It does not rerun benchmarks. It plots the published results, and every point names its source and date.

end
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.500
aicharts. aicharts.io. Benchmark charts free and live. Usage collector in development.
